O['copy-powers-off-claim'] = ("Fixed in the README ('With They take their own recoil off every contest's result is as before (pull request 3's page: the verdict, chips, tiles, effort box and items; the Collide four-cases grids have new labels covering both settings, decision 16)') and the PR body. Re-checked after the fixes: with every power off, 28 two-player states at four efforts (112) read the same as 238f570's page and 109 of 112 as #34's (the three are the fireball case's added note); the engine's two-player results with They take their own recoil off equal #34's engine's (4,928 calls, the bounce fix aside). Copy only, so no revert.", [])
